<!-- Reference -->
<div class="pg-section" id="section-6">
  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Reference</h3>
  <div class="docs-table-wrap">
    <table class="sui-table sui-table-compact">
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col" style="width:40%;">Attribute / Event / Class</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>data-sui-copy</code></td><td>Makes the button copy on click. A value copies that string; empty reads the <code>.sui-copy-text</code> or <code>.sui-input</code> in the same <code>.sui-copy</code> / <code>.sui-copy-input</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-copy</code> event</td><td>Fires on success with <code>detail.text</code>. The check shows for 1.5s, then the button's own content returns. Falls back to <code>execCommand('copy')</code> where the Clipboard API is missing or denied (e.g. plain http).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-copy-error</code> event</td><td>Fires on failure with <code>detail.text</code> and <code>detail.error</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.copied</code></td><td>Added on success while the check shows.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.copy-failed</code></td><td>Added on failure: danger colour and a cross for 1.5s.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
